{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Se1Mmh6chZ1793070110.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析認為，港股後市要視乎聯儲局議息及對經濟前瞻判斷，預期23,600點有阻力。</p><p></p><p>Blue Water Capital首席投資官李澤銘說︰「雖然議息結果應沒意外、維持利率不變，不過大家均觀望對於下一次議息會否有進一步指引。聯儲局本身對經濟判斷，包括就業及經濟增長情況，尤其是現時關稅穩定下來後，或中東局勢若持續，對於未來通脹判斷究竟如何。暫時看到有溫和技術反彈，反彈阻力位目標放在10天線位置，23,600、23,700點左右。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:22:05.152171+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:28.793415+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:28.793415+00:00","content_hash":"20c80543be978fd02df719046b4719e06b8cf2669c84c1615d1c4f600a376d71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}